<title>UK: BNP unit sets $200 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNP unit sets $200 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BNP London.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BNP PACIFIC (AUSTRALIA) LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    24.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.87    PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.895    SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.975     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND W/I JANUARY 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	*US/UK/FR/AU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
